1
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,110
Eldrie?

2
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,940
I know that name.

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,840
Hey, get ready.

4
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:10,680
I'm gonna keep him busy.

5
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,960
When I give the signal, you're up. Got it.

6
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:18,740
Using your chains as a weapon, huh?

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,920
Then I'll forego my sword.

8
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:23,480
And use this instead.

9
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,080
System Call.

10
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,900
Enhance Armament.

11
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:30,160
Don't sweat it.

12
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:32,160
A whip can only reach so far.

13
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:34,960
We're safe here.

14
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:42,870
Impressive.

15
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:47,720
My divine frost scale whip is fast, but
it seems you're faster. You all right?

16
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:50,720
His whip did that?

17
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:54,757
Yu-Gi-Oh, I'll try to find
a way to stop his whip.

18
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,134
You sneak around back.

19
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:01,300
If you've finished plotting,
we should wrap this up.

20
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:04,620
Now, come at me and keep me entertained.

21
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:51,732
To you, the big yourself

22
00:02:01,540 --> 00:02:03,557
Shining Sun My Diamond

23
00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:23,893
The future of the world will be the
best you will be the best you will be.

24
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:47,841
Thermal element.

25
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:51,580
Generate cryogenic element.

26
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:55,540
Form element.

27
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:56,860
Arrow shape.

28
00:02:57,220 --> 00:02:58,560
Form element.

29
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,100
Bird shape.

30
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,780
Counter thermal object.

31
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,720
Discharge.

32
00:03:06,180 --> 00:03:07,340
Discharge.

33
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:32,220
It seems I overestimated you.

34
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,620
However, I am merciful.

35
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:37,612
You'll be unconscious before you know it.

36
00:03:49,380 --> 00:03:50,320
My turn!

37
00:03:54,260 --> 00:03:58,000
Perhaps it was presumptuous of
me to underestimate you earlier.

38
00:03:58,420 --> 00:04:02,020
It seems you've managed to
do me some harm after all.

39
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,397
Yeah, well, that's what you get.

40
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:07,460
I must say, your style of combat.

41
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:11,600
There's something oddly
familiar about it. Really?

42
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:17,037
Then I guess you must have come up against
a swordsman of the surloop style before.

43
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:19,720
That, my dear criminal, is not possible.

44
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:25,160
As I previously said, I was summoned as
a knight to this realm one month ago.

45
00:04:25,620 --> 00:04:27,360
Yeah, right, I bet you were.

46
00:04:28,420 --> 00:04:29,420
How's that work?

47
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:32,798
Does someone snap their
fingers and you come running?

48
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,200
Release Recollection.

49
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:06,140
No wonder Lady Alice was wary of you.

50
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:10,960
Your attacks have no pattern, which
is surprising and slightly irritating.

51
00:05:11,340 --> 00:05:15,600
What irritates me more is you forced
me to use my memory release skill.

52
00:05:17,420 --> 00:05:18,260
That's it.

53
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:21,464
Yeah, now I know where I
heard your name before.

54
00:05:22,580 --> 00:05:26,462
You were the champion swordsman
this year for Norlinggarth Empire.

55
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:29,800
And then, you won the
unification tournament.

56
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,840
You're Eldriei Wolfsburg.

57
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:36,280
Champion from the Norlinggarth Empire?

58
00:05:38,420 --> 00:05:39,620
Eldriei Wolfsburg?

59
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:41,194
It's true, Sir Knight.

60
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:46,157
This year, if I remember correctly, you
won every match with a single stroke.

61
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,480
What are you saying?

62
00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:49,940
That's preposterous.

63
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:52,020
I am Eldrie Synthesis 31.

64
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:56,600
I have never heard the name
Wolfsburg before. But... Enough!

65
00:05:56,980 --> 00:05:59,300
Hold your tongue, you blasphemer.

66
00:06:00,020 --> 00:06:02,680
I was summoned to this
world by the Pontifex.

67
00:06:03,020 --> 00:06:05,520
I am here by Administrator's will.

68
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:09,885
I descended as an Integrity Knight
from the heavens, I tell you.

69
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:26,040
What's that?

70
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:33,860
I bet Alice got one of those too when
they blocked her memory and changed her.

71
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,510
Eldrie!

72
00:06:36,593 --> 00:06:37,560
Eldrie Wolfsburg!

73
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,057
Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!

74
00:06:41,140 --> 00:06:42,657
Know anything else about him?

75
00:06:42,740 --> 00:06:43,720
Anything at all?

76
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:46,273
Something to trigger more of his memory?

77
00:06:46,620 --> 00:06:47,480
Eldrie!

78
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:52,320
Your father is Estor Wolfsburg,
the Imperial Knight's general.

79
00:06:52,580 --> 00:06:55,820
Your mother's name is, I think, Almera?

80
00:06:56,060 --> 00:06:57,740
Yeah, it's Almera!

81
00:07:01,900 --> 00:07:02,760
Almera...

82
00:07:06,140 --> 00:07:06,970
Ma...

83
00:07:07,053 --> 00:07:08,080
Thur...

84
00:07:09,700 --> 00:07:10,530
That's right!

85
00:07:10,613 --> 00:07:11,443
Remember her!

86
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,640
Remember her!

87
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:15,480
Kirito!

88
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,640
You okay?

89
00:07:29,060 --> 00:07:31,840
Step away from Knight 31, criminals.

90
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:37,080
Tempting an integrity knight to
fall from grace is unforgivable.

91
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,700
You wretches.

92
00:07:39,060 --> 00:07:42,820
I shall pin you down, then
return you to your cell.

93
00:07:43,980 --> 00:07:44,960
This way!

94
00:07:52,060 --> 00:07:53,020
Which way?

95
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:55,180
Go right.

96
00:07:55,980 --> 00:07:57,500
Yu-Gi-Oh, go right!

97
00:08:05,460 --> 00:08:06,880
Dead end up ahead!

98
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,100
What do we do?

99
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:09,910
Hey!

100
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,580
Over here!

101
00:08:12,180 --> 00:08:13,120
Follow her.

102
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:35,940
Where are we?

103
00:08:38,700 --> 00:08:40,171
Now they know we're here.

104
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:42,518
We can't use this back door anymore.

105
00:08:54,660 --> 00:08:55,490
Thank you.

106
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:57,137
We were really in a bind.

107
00:08:57,220 --> 00:08:59,020
Who are you? I'm Yu-Gi-Oh.

108
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:00,157
It's nice to meet you.

109
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,070
Wait a sec.

110
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,860
And this is Kirito.

111
00:09:08,260 --> 00:09:10,300
We really appreciate your help.

112
00:09:10,540 --> 00:09:11,677
Is this some...

113
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:12,700
where you live?

114
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:15,020
No, of course it isn't.

115
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:17,520
Come with me.

116
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:24,480
So, uh, are we in the Central Cathedral?

117
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:28,000
Yes and no, but neither
of you have to worry.

118
00:09:28,700 --> 00:09:31,657
Although the space is
technically in the Cathedral,

119
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:34,034
I've deleted the regular doorway to it.

120
00:09:34,220 --> 00:09:36,691
No one can enter here from that point now.

121
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:40,160
Well, unless I invite them.

122
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:55,917
It's a library indeed.

123
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:59,477
The records of this world's
entire history are here,

124
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:03,137
as well as the formulas of
everything created under the heavens.

125
00:10:03,220 --> 00:10:08,817
That includes every system command or
what you refer to as the sacred arts.

126
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:09,730
Wait.

127
00:10:09,813 --> 00:10:10,817
System commands.

128
00:10:10,900 --> 00:10:12,397
Who are you?

129
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:14,237
My name is Cardinal.

130
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:17,337
I was once the regulator of this world,

131
00:10:17,420 --> 00:10:21,297
but now I am the sole curator
of this great library.

132
00:10:21,380 --> 00:10:24,377
All our history.

133
00:10:24,460 --> 00:10:25,290
Precisely.

134
00:10:25,373 --> 00:10:29,377
There is also a record of the
creation when Vecta and Stacia

135
00:10:29,460 --> 00:10:32,617
split the world into the human
empire and the dark territory.

136
00:10:32,700 --> 00:10:35,857
You may read them if you wish.

137
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:39,540
But first, would you hold out your

138
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:45,870
right hands?

139
00:10:45,953 --> 00:10:46,783
There.

140
00:10:46,866 --> 00:10:52,760
You

141
00:10:52,900 --> 00:10:53,730
feeling

142
00:10:53,813 --> 00:10:54,643
okay? Yeah.

143
00:10:54,726 --> 00:11:00,957
You're going to catch a cold if
you stay in those wet clothes.

144
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:04,577
At the end of the hall, through
there, you'll find a small bath.

145
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:05,490
You may use.

146
00:11:05,573 --> 00:11:07,857
Thanks a lot.

147
00:11:07,940 --> 00:11:09,737
I'm grateful for your hospitality.

148
00:11:09,820 --> 00:11:14,697
Can I um see the um record of creation?

149
00:11:14,780 --> 00:11:19,697
It is located up the stairs
in the history section.

150
00:11:19,780 --> 00:11:22,757
After you bathe, you may
read it. With your supper.

151
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:25,117
You're much too kind.

152
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,960
I'll be back in a bit. Then.

153
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:34,460
What those records won't reveal?

154
00:11:35,100 --> 00:11:39,280
Is that the Pontifex of the Axiom
Church fabricated all of it?

155
00:11:40,060 --> 00:11:41,297
Let me get this straight.

156
00:11:41,380 --> 00:11:44,500
You're saying the gods here are fake? Yes.

157
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:49,557
The myths the people of the underworld
believe are just propaganda!

158
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:52,900
All invented by the church
to maintain its control.

159
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:58,420
The gods' names are registered as
supervisor accounts, in case of emergency.

160
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:02,660
But the humans outside
never logged in using them.

161
00:12:04,060 --> 00:12:05,120
Wait a sec!

162
00:12:05,380 --> 00:12:08,157
How would you know anything
about the real world?

163
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:10,122
You weren't born here, were you?

164
00:12:10,340 --> 00:12:13,200
You're an outsider, just
like the system admins!

165
00:12:14,300 --> 00:12:15,130
Yes.

166
00:12:15,213 --> 00:12:19,060
And I know you're an outsider
too, Kirito the Unregistered.

167
00:12:20,860 --> 00:12:22,340
Yeah, I am.

168
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:25,955
A company called Wrath is
the one that made this world.

169
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:28,300
You know that. Yes, I do.

170
00:12:28,620 --> 00:12:30,796
Then you must be the Cardinal System.

171
00:12:31,040 --> 00:12:33,237
You're an autonomous program, aren't you?

172
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,620
You run this world.

173
00:12:35,380 --> 00:12:37,117
Ah, so you know about me.

174
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:40,847
Then you've interacted with my
kind before in the Outer World.

175
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:43,877
Oh, yeah.

176
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:46,240
But you're different.

177
00:12:46,620 --> 00:12:50,757
As far as I know, the Cardinal System
never had a human-like interface.

178
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:53,060
So what kind of program are you?

179
00:12:53,340 --> 00:12:54,880
What do you do here?

180
00:12:59,140 --> 00:13:01,637
I'll try to be as succinct as possible.

181
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,180
But first, eat.

182
00:13:08,100 --> 00:13:11,806
I've cast a spell on it that will
help your wounds heal faster.

183
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,060
Wow, now that's an admin for you.

184
00:13:14,300 --> 00:13:15,860
I am not an administrator.

185
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:20,299
I can only manipulate the objects
that are contained in this library.

186
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:25,877
Oh, Cardinal, can you get in touch
with someone in the real world for me?

187
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:26,790
Of course not.

188
00:13:26,873 --> 00:13:28,040
If I could do that,

189
00:13:28,220 --> 00:13:32,279
I wouldn't be stuck here in this
dusty place for all these centuries.

190
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:35,877
Unfortunately, the only one who
has that authority is the Pontifex.

191
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:37,040
Ugh, crap.

192
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:38,470
There.

193
00:13:43,820 --> 00:13:47,500
I told you earlier that no
gods exist in this world.

194
00:13:48,780 --> 00:13:53,337
Technically that's true, but there was
once a time when something similar did.

195
00:13:53,420 --> 00:13:56,060
That was about 450 years ago.

196
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:59,780
Back when Senator was no
more than a tiny village,

197
00:14:00,420 --> 00:14:01,655
there were four gods.

198
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:03,140
Let me guess.

199
00:14:03,420 --> 00:14:06,797
They were the four staff members
from Wrath who built this place.

200
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:07,821
You are correct.

201
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:11,480
Two males and two females
came to this land.

202
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:15,059
Each couple raised eight
children each on two farms.

203
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:20,220
They taught them to read and write, and
how to raise crops and livestock too,

204
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:23,320
and the moral arguments of good and evil?

205
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:25,931
which formed the basis of the Taboo Index.

206
00:14:26,560 --> 00:14:31,177
Based on how effectively the first four
were able to pass down these teachings,

207
00:14:31,260 --> 00:14:35,000
it's clear that as humans, they
were incredibly intelligent.

208
00:14:35,820 --> 00:14:41,660
However, there was one among them who was
not only brilliant, but devious as well.

209
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:45,660
The children this person raised
inherited selfish desires,

210
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:48,254
such as the hunger to rule and conquer.

211
00:14:49,060 --> 00:14:49,890
However,

212
00:14:49,973 --> 00:14:53,037
the offspring of these children would
eventually become the nobles of this land,

213
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:56,180
as well as the High Ministers
of the Axiom Church.

214
00:14:56,820 --> 00:14:59,900
One of them, the current
system's supervisor,

215
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:02,438
is the Pontifex of the Axiom Church,

216
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:06,040
a woman who controls
everything with an iron fist.

217
00:15:07,380 --> 00:15:11,321
She calls herself Administrator,
the most arrogant name imaginable.

218
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:13,037
That name…

219
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:15,640
I heard that Eldrie guy say it.

220
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:17,370
That's right.

221
00:15:17,453 --> 00:15:21,352
He said he was, like, summoned by this
Pontifex Administrator or something.

222
00:15:21,580 --> 00:15:24,140
Yes, she's the one I've
been talking about.

223
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,150
Sadly,

224
00:15:26,233 --> 00:15:29,160
this Administrator, while
I don't like to admit it,

225
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:31,520
is my elder twin sister, so to speak.

226
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:32,620
She is?

227
00:15:32,740 --> 00:15:33,681
How do you mean?

228
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:35,056
I'm getting to that.

229
00:15:35,660 --> 00:15:38,520
Several decades after the
first four logged out,

230
00:15:38,780 --> 00:15:43,560
the first political marriage was arranged
between two families of the Lord Class.

231
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:46,800
From that union, a baby girl was born.

232
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:52,917
Her name was Queen Nella.

233
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,700
Queen Nella, my dear!

234
00:15:56,760 --> 00:16:00,137
Henceforth, your calling is
to research the sacred arts.

235
00:16:00,220 --> 00:16:02,597
Nothing would make me happier, Father!

236
00:16:02,680 --> 00:16:03,960
Thank you.

237
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:07,757
System, call.

238
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:10,017
No one else realizes it.

239
00:16:10,100 --> 00:16:12,720
But each sacred word has its own meaning.

240
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:15,177
Call means to summon.

241
00:16:15,260 --> 00:16:17,400
Generate means to produce.

242
00:16:20,780 --> 00:16:22,680
Come on, this way!

243
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:34,360
System call.

244
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:36,700
Generate thermal element.

245
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:39,520
Form element. Arrow shape.

246
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:41,260
Fly straight. Discharge!

247
00:16:59,300 --> 00:17:05,040
Lady Queeniella, please help my
husband walk again. Very well.

248
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:08,240
System call.

249
00:17:08,700 --> 00:17:10,700
Generate luminous element.

250
00:17:11,300 --> 00:17:12,600
Form element.

251
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:13,960
Liquid shape.

252
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:21,580
It's a miracle.

253
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:25,660
Lady Quinella, you are
the holy child of Stacia.

254
00:17:27,820 --> 00:17:30,260
But her gentle smile was a mask.

255
00:17:30,940 --> 00:17:36,460
Quinella had developed a thirst for power,
and now she had the means to seize it.

256
00:17:41,020 --> 00:17:44,920
Very soon, we will have a place
where we can worship the gods.

257
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:55,780
In order to control
the growing population,

258
00:17:56,180 --> 00:18:02,520
I must put some laws into place to ensure
no one else exceeds my authority level.

259
00:18:03,980 --> 00:18:06,017
I will make hunting taboo.

260
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:08,640
I will outlaw murder as well.

261
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:16,220
Lady Quinella, you wish to see me?

262
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:20,880
This is a holy book containing the
complete words of the goddess Stacia.

263
00:18:21,100 --> 00:18:23,100
It is called the Taboo Index.

264
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:28,700
Make copies, distribute it to every town
and village, and have the people obey it.

265
00:18:29,060 --> 00:18:30,060
Yes, my lady.

266
00:18:38,660 --> 00:18:41,640
Oh my god.

267
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:03,300
System call.

268
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:05,720
Open list.

269
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:10,580
List, system, call, read, list.

270
00:19:25,660 --> 00:19:28,860
System, call, inspect, list.

271
00:19:32,360 --> 00:19:34,800
Finally, Quinella opened it.

272
00:19:35,940 --> 00:19:37,720
The Forbidden Door.

273
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:43,426
It was quite the coincidence.

274
00:19:44,500 --> 00:19:48,280
Although I suspect someone from
the outside world helped her.

275
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:50,661
Let me show you.

276
00:19:51,300 --> 00:19:52,180
System call.

277
00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:54,820
Inspect entire command list.

278
00:19:56,980 --> 00:19:58,300
You're kidding.

279
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:04,300
What you see before you is the full catalog
of all the Underworld system commands.

280
00:20:05,160 --> 00:20:07,297
Quinella's first order of business was to

281
00:20:07,380 --> 00:20:10,100
restore her life and
halt the aging process.

282
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:13,060
Then, she restored her beauty.

283
00:20:15,380 --> 00:20:20,240
In an instant, she regained the
dazzling allure of her late teens.

284
00:20:25,280 --> 00:20:27,940
That should have been
enough to satisfy her.

285
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:29,720
But no.

286
00:20:30,260 --> 00:20:33,600
For Quinella, there could
be no one equal to her.

287
00:20:35,340 --> 00:20:38,811
Even the Cardinal System was
something she deemed a threat.

288
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:42,617
So she devised a way to
seize the Cardinal System's

289
00:20:42,700 --> 00:20:46,540
authority level using a sacred
art command she composed.

290
00:20:47,420 --> 00:20:48,560
As a result,

291
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:53,377
she burned the Prime Directive
of the Cardinal System

292
00:20:53,460 --> 00:20:56,519
into her flux light as her
own behavioral principle.

293
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:59,020
That way, it could not be overwritten.

294
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:01,780
She just wanted its authority level.

295
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:06,106
Instead, she ended up fusing her
soul with the Cardinal System.

296
00:21:07,160 --> 00:21:08,180
To uphold order.

297
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:13,607
That is the prime directive of the Cardinal
System and its reason for existing.

298
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:17,257
As someone who spent time in a
world controlled by the same system,

299
00:21:17,340 --> 00:21:18,634
you should understand.

300
00:21:19,020 --> 00:21:21,961
Cardinal observes the
actions of players like you,

301
00:21:22,140 --> 00:21:25,897
and it corrects anything that
disrupts the balance of the world.

302
00:21:25,980 --> 00:21:27,600
Without any mercy.

303
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:37,460
Queen Ella had fainted and was
unconscious for an entire day.

304
00:21:38,300 --> 00:21:42,860
When she woke up, she had ceased
being human in any sense of the word.

305
00:21:43,620 --> 00:21:46,900
She no longer aged or required sustenance.

306
00:21:47,260 --> 00:21:52,140
Her only desire was to preserve this
realm in its current state forever.

307
00:21:53,780 --> 00:21:56,480
I am both ruler and supervisor.

308
00:21:57,060 --> 00:22:00,940
And now, the Pontifex of
the Axiom Church as well.

309
00:22:02,100 --> 00:22:04,320
I am administrator.

310
00:22:20,320 --> 00:22:23,360
If you see the light of the sun,

311
00:22:24,780 --> 00:22:25,857
I will bloom in the night.

312
00:23:17,700 --> 00:23:20,740
I'd be hiding the hurt that hurt.

313
00:23:21,700 --> 00:23:24,460
I'd be able to heal a little bit.

314
00:23:27,020 --> 00:23:28,820
Realist to you!
